  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1301.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1301.02 Applicability. These rules shall apply to:\n\n(a) Individuals who live, work, and recreate on the surface waters of New Hampshire; and\n\n(b) Persons who:\n\n(1) Own or manage places of business that offer the sale or other distribution of exotic aquatic weeds; or\n\n(2) Are responsible for or are otherwise interested in monitoring, maintaining, or investigating exotic aquatic weed-related water quality.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1300) #8703-A, eff 9-5-06; ss by #10696, eff 10-18-14 (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1300); ss by #14186, eff 1-25-25",
